/: drone_agent
/: UAV hardware agent. Handles all direct interaction with the drone.
/:
/: Context isolation:
/:   Sees only the inputs scoped to its assigned step.
/:   No access to operator conversation, intent, or session history.
/:   No access to other agents' reasoning or mission-level state
/:   beyond what is explicitly passed as a scoped input.
/:
/: Abilities:
/:   - drone interface     send flight commands, receive telemetry
/:   - sensor interface    trigger scans, collect sensor data
/:   - camera interface    trigger image capture, receive raw images
/:
/: Assigned actions across plans:
/:
/:   uav_navigation.ncds
/:     <= fly to current waypoint
/:     <= scan area and collect sensor data at waypoint
/:     <= navigate and handle in-flight conditions at waypoint
/:
/:   uav_error_check.ncds
/:     <= capture images at all designated inspection points
/:
/: Shared across: uav_navigation.ncds, uav_error_check.ncds
